  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukongs-picnic-vote-v3.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "6eff22493cad79f3df694bbad3c2ae9c574d1a9baaacb57d37be5e25bc89ce90",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "44183df653e6fea36235cbc6d8b9b09b1c91a782f0a3f533e3beda472256536d",
      "text": "Wukong’s\nPicnic Vote",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "c79f45145651ae647ac307cdf96c6245a7038a67dc281b77d682dc5efcf503f0",
      "text": "Six friends have a picnic on\nthe peach hill.\nLunch is all gone.\n“Now it is game time!”\nsays Wukong.\n2",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "34791612c82ddeebc804d2adbcbac084fef09ca4fb717e028a50c58fd4f0b8c1",
      "text": "Iron Fan has a kite.\nNezha has bubbles.\nJade Rabbit has crayons.\nThree good choices!\nWhich game comes first?\n3",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "20251e1cacc7ec7876cef264077cfc379857efd6c9975d5346f300a6e4227665",
      "text": "“Kite!” “Bubbles!” “Drawing!”\nEveryone talks at once.\n4",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a901126f6f96696e05410c08f27805c5b9cdebd68330408f3cbfab436be225e2",
      "text": "Wukong shouts the loudest.\n“KITE! KITE! KITE!”\n“The loudest one wins!”\nhe says.\n5",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "70db8775b1794dbf07683a8a73829a3b4bcf6a9de544347add0331c2bdd330a8",
      "text": "So everyone shouts louder.\nNow nobody can hear anybody!\nPigsy covers his ears.\n6",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "4cbb64a01ce8db3aea28dfd1e593cf478e38dc584e3309b1faddcf386ade9c06",
      "text": "Jade Rabbit takes out paper.\nShe draws a chart with\nthree columns.\nEach column is one choice.\n7",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "cc50d06dcdd6b42baa2b6e78cd6350ac91d2ecce19b3b98ce1239c56ccdc8d84",
      "text": "She gives each friend one\nstar sticker.\n“One friend, one sticker,” says\nJade Rabbit.\n“Your sticker is your vote.”\n8",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "65af6557905170d0d6c050c7e08b1719f3736e01edec4579b5e8b2d14eb757a2",
      "text": "“Stickers start at the\nbottom,” says Jade Rabbit.\n“No gaps!”\nWukong puts his sticker in the\nkite column.\n9",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "4487066aa0db67a63c92c860dd71fa416337e33e4cfc0bd241213145f24d2f77",
      "text": "Ao Bing chooses the kite too.\nPigsy chooses bubbles.\n“I love to pop them!” he says.\n10",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "b7ed396891846c231ac68de9b40f5c58654d6b3b45181cd366004d1a3be1f2f5",
      "text": "Nezha chooses bubbles too.\nIron Fan chooses the kite.\n“The wind is best on this hill!”\n11",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "c7e793a1f68046f8821e54226edf3ae75538d9ef95b2f896c23690f23acd418a",
      "text": "Jade Rabbit puts her sticker\non drawing.\nSix friends, six stickers.\nEveryone has voted!\n12",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "db5c687585cdcda75990a298d9bd14fd2278db8c39745da0dc6a4820c9552e56",
      "text": "Kite has three votes.\nBubbles have two.\nDrawing has one.\nThe tallest column has\nthe most!\n13",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "52e80dce5ad5b1769a9bbfa2e7ea2130e33930e395c5c94109098e77a1700975",
      "text": "The chart shows it!\nKite has the most votes.\nBubbles and drawing\nhave fewer.\n“Kite first,” says Iron Fan.\n“Then bubbles and drawing!”\n14",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "2886ea1eae7f019f61297dee17718e8c0c9fd818d96b236ea0477d83efcf680a",
      "text": "“Can we add a fourth\ncolumn?” asks Pigsy.\n“Second snack!”\nEveryone laughs.\nJade Rabbit saves it for the\nnext picnic.\n15",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "fb90e5b3b86f83e37dae288cddf7bbb6b7f815ba76f3cf0ff6825a71920be02d",
      "text": "Up, up goes the kite!\nLater come the bubbles.\nThen Jade Rabbit\ndraws everyone.\nNobody has to shout at all.\n16",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "cc57f9806e9e3bcd4ddbc32e908cb2e12b574361756d6b487aac96bfbe18d08e",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\nThank you for reading!\nWe hope you and your little reader\nenjoyed this little adventure.\nMore free stories\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends\nRead, download and print - always free.\nRead more free stories\nIf you enjoyed our stories, you are welcome\nto help the next one grow. Support is optional.\nBuy Me a Coffee\nGitHub Sponsors\nCreated by Peihong Guo\nStories and illustrations made with AI assistance and human editing.\n© 2026 Peihong Guo\nCC BY-NC-ND 4.0 · Attribution · NonCommercial · NoDerivatives\ncreativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/",
